# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# Source material: Figma exports, the Framer originals, the raw inspection
# recording, and the eight full-length tracks the shipped previews are cut
# from. ~110MB, imported by nothing, excluded from typecheck and lint.
#
# Untracked as of the commit that added the audio previews, so a depth-1 CI
# clone no longer pulls it. It is still in *history* — removing it from there
# is a rewrite and is not something to do casually.
#
# No longer on disk here either: it was deleted in the pre-launch clean-out,
# and Siddhant keeps the originals in his own backup. `scripts/trim-audio.mjs`
# reads it when it is present and falls back to `public/` when it is not, so
# the script still runs — it just cannot re-cut a preview from a full-length
# master any more without the folder being restored first. The rule stays so
# that restoring it never re-tracks 110MB by accident.
/references

# Not source material and not ours — an APK that landed in references/photos.
*.apk

# The content intake questionnaire — the gaps the site is waiting on words for,
# and the table recording where the published CV and this site disagree.
#
# A working document between Siddhant and whoever is helping him write, and it
# reads as one: it names which numbers contradict each other and which of them
# undersell him. This repository is public, and a recruiter who finds it should
# find the work, not the notes about what the work is still missing. Kept on
# disk, kept out of the repo.
/CONTENT-INTAKE.md
